  "description": "<p data-end=\"342\" data-start=\"102\"><strong data-end=\"121\" data-start=\"102\">Sirvan Perfumes</strong> is an Australian luxury fragrance brand inspired by the rich heritage of the Middle East. Our collection blends timeless Arabian elegance with modern craftsmanship, delivering a captivating experience with every spray.</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"668\" data-start=\"344\">Our signature fragrances are crafted with high-quality ingredients, carefully sourced and blended to create unforgettable scent journeys. From bold and intense oud-based aromas to soft and tranquil floral notes, each perfume tells a story of identity and elegance. Discover the perfect scent that resonates with your soul.</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"910\" data-start=\"670\"><strong data-end=\"701\" data-start=\"670\">Why Choose Sirvan Perfumes?</strong><br data-end=\"704\" data-start=\"701\">Our fragrances bridge the gap between Middle Eastern opulence and Australian modernity. Known for their long-lasting, luxurious quality, they are crafted for those who value sophistication and refinement.</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"1080\" data-start=\"912\"><strong data-end=\"937\" data-start=\"912\">Payment and Shipping:</strong><br data-end=\"940\" data-start=\"937\">We offer secure payment options including credit card, PayPal, and Afterpay. Enjoy free shipping on all orders over $200 within Australia.</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"1290\" data-start=\"1082\"><strong data-end=\"1101\" data-start=\"1082\">Stay Connected:</strong><br data-end=\"1104\" data-start=\"1101\">Join our community of fragrance lovers and immerse yourself in the world of Sirvan Perfumes. Follow us on Instagram and Facebook to stay updated on new releases and special promotions.</p>",
